  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORCAP Strategic Humanitarian Partnership/Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of humanitarian personell on short notice to the United Nation and other organisations strengthening their capacity to efficiently protect lives and livelihood of affected populations in crisis. Proactive civilian protection in the humanitarian and peacebuilding sectors. Protection of civilians from violence, abuse, and violations of international law, as well as contribute to improved coordination and capacity for proactive protection interventions. NORCAP experts work to ensure effective protection of affected girls, boys, women and men during all phases of a crisis. By deploying experts on protection, child protection, gender based violence and gender, NORCAP contributes to more effective and better-coordinated protection efforts on the ground. Experts in the NORCAP roster and thematic rosters ProCap and GenCap, provide analysis of needs, conflict drivers and patterns of displacement as well as develop scenarios for early warning.</narrative>
  </description>
